  "description": "The Almighty Gaylords Nation is a European-American Chicago street gang founded in 1952 in the West Town neighborhood at Grand Avenue and Noble Street, initially composed mostly of Italian Americans. A member of the People Nation alliance — with allies including the Latin Kings, Vice Lords, and Indiana Aryan Brotherhood — the gang expanded to sets across the North, West, and South Sides at its peak. It declined in the 1990s as key leaders were incarcerated; in 2011, nine suburban members were arrested for drug dealing and gun trafficking.",
